    "summary": "This option is open to a unit that is [unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range), [Advanced](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) this turn and carries at least one **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** weapon. Only **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** weapons can be chosen for its attacks, which follow [Making Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks) (04). For the rest of the phase it may not begin an Action.",
